भू॑यंस् (compar.) more, greater, larger, mightier, more
numerous, abundant, or important;
 also w. the mgs of the positive or
superl. (very) great, etc.;
 full of, abounding in (instr. or —˚).
भू॑यस् n. adv. more, most, very much, further, moreover, again (often
doubled, also भूयोऽपि, भूयश्चापि & पुर्नभूयस्);
 instr. भूयसा
exceedingly, in a high degree, mostly, generally.

भू॑यिष्ठ (superl.) most, greatest, chiefest;
 very
abundant, numerous, or important;
 mostly consisting of, chiefly filled
with or accompanied by (—˚);
 nearly, almost (—˚ after a pp., e.g.
गतभूयिष्ठ nearly gone). n. adv. mostly, chiefly, very much (also
instr).
